title: "Cognitive Sovereignty Framework v3.0.0: A Six-Domain Model for Human Resilience in the AI Era"
authors:
  - name: "Cyber Strategy Institute"
    website: "https://cyberstrategyinstitute.com"
version: "3.0.0"
